### Global CSS

To customize the Pagination component classes, you can use the `@layer components` directive.
[Learn more](https://tailwindcss.com/docs/adding-custom-styles#adding-component-classes).

```css
@layer components {
  .pagination {
    @apply gap-8;
  }

  .pagination__link {
    @apply rounded-md;
  }

  .pagination__summary {
    @apply text-xs font-semibold;
  }
}
```

